1. Consuming Gold Pounds can send bound gold gifts. Claiming gifts can obtain equivalent bound Gold Pounds; 
 2. 24 hours after the bound gold gift is sent, unclaimed gifts will be returned as an equivalent amount of bound gold; 
 3. If there are outfits in the appearance gift that have not been claimed after 24 hours, the equivalent Gold Pounds and gift quota consumed when purchasing the outfit will be returned; 
 4. Items obtained from appearance gifts are bound items.
